  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given expression is,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Now, minimum <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to <math><mn>1</mn></math><br />when <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi></math>&nbsp;lies on the line segment joining <math><mn>1</mn></math> &amp; <math><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>and minimum <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equals to <math><mn>0</mn></math>,&nbsp;when&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> Minimum of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to <math><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math> at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>",
